<div class="section">
  <h2>Quick Example: Share via CLI</h2>
  <pre style="background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1.25rem;margin-top:1.25rem;overflow-x:auto"><code style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--green);line-height:1.7"># Create a self-destructing drop with your API key
